  +       '<div class="partition-cell"><h5>02. Guest Annexe</h5><span class="sub">180 m² Internal</span><ul><li>Autonomous 2-bedroom self-contained wing</li><li>Private kitchen, salon, and garden verandah</li><li>Designed for visiting consular delegates or kin</li></ul></div>'
  +       '<div class="partition-cell"><h5>03. Staff Quarters (BQ)</h5><span class="sub">110 m² Internal</span><ul><li>4 dedicated staff rooms with shared utilities</li><li>Commercial laundry and linen preparation yard</li></ul></div>'
  +       '<div class="partition-cell"><h5>04. Defensive Outpost</h5><span class="sub">Compound Periphery</span><ul><li>Two-tier reinforced security gatehouse</li><li>Raised watchtower overlooking perimeter avenues</li></ul></div>'
  +     '</div>'
